{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:33 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:33 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:33 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"半導體股強勢反彈  英特爾美光領漲 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf72de7bf0080fc691bcb1e9344f3c79/2026-10/stock_photo_4_1200x676_0.jpg\"/><p>上星期連跌多天的半導體股，周一在美股盤中強勢反彈，費城半導體指數盤初升逾3%，多隻晶片股錄得顯著升幅。</p><p>英特爾（INTC）及邁威爾科技（MRVL）雙雙升逾5%，美光科技（MU）升逾4%；超微半導體（AMD）、應用材料（AMAT）亦升逾3%，SK海力士（SKHY）亦升近6%，反映半導體板塊普遍造好。</p><p>納指盤中升300點，升幅約1.4%。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T14:42:02.769171+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:33:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:17:46.041879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:39:14.994605+00:00","content_hash":"4f3bffc3a15afb17b3ad2ec723edca37fc57adaa484aab2e96a96fb369d7052c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}